{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["way/292127150"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 200 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Apapa. These are the hull of the port area below grown by 200 m, cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the port area kept whole and a 30 m margin where it meets the water. What is left is the port and the harbour water off its quays, clear of Tin Can Island's limits to the west. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no homes, schools, hospitals, places of worship or named places inside; the shore edges of three unnamed residential areas and of Lagos Island reach in by about 0.25 ha in all, none of it more than 40 m inside the limits.","inside":{"houses":0,"residential_m2":1362,"residential":[{"osm":"way/435779599","m2":709},{"osm":"way/786552743","m2":406},{"osm":"way/787280014","m2":247}],"amenities":0}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[3.375336,6.435202],[3.375923,6.434812],[3.379868,6.43417],[3.380418,6.434359],[3.381066,6.434389],[3.383771,6.434194],[3.384087,6.434135],[3.384827,6.43367],[3.384747,6.433413],[3.392407,6.432224],[3.3931,6.432361],[3.394991,6.433191],[3.395578,6.433581],[3.39597,6.434165],[3.397378,6.437482],[3.397516,6.43817],[3.397378,6.438858],[3.396986,6.439442],[3.385888,6.45147],[3.383019,6.452949],[3.381549,6.453995],[3.380488,6.455305],[3.379948,6.456356],[3.379775,6.457002],[3.379736,6.458137],[3.373238,6.465179],[3.372994,6.465106],[3.372717,6.465208],[3.37179,6.466207],[3.371403,6.466334],[3.37127,6.466744],[3.370353,6.466793],[3.370851,6.465468],[3.370864,6.465269],[3.370588,6.465207],[3.370551,6.46493],[3.370259,6.464865],[3.369592,6.464733],[3.369548,6.464733],[3.369491,6.464755],[3.369396,6